@startuml
title Успешная SAGA записи с оплатой и лабораторным резервом

actor "Пациент" as Patient
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Mobile API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Mobile BFF" as BFF
database "Idempotency Store" as Idem
participant "Booking Orchestrator" as Saga
participant "Policy Verification" as Policy
participant "Schedule" as Schedule
participant "LIS Adapter" as LIS
participant "Payment Adapter" as Pay
participant "Payment Gateway" as Provider
queue "Event Broker" as Broker
participant "Notification Service" as Notify

Patient -> App: Подтвердить запись и оплату
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/booking-operations\nAuthorization, Idempotency-Key
Gateway -> Gateway: Проверить токен, rate limit и тело
Gateway -> BFF: Запрос + исходный token\nпо mTLS
BFF -> BFF: Повторно проверить token,\nполучить patientId из sub
BFF -> Saga: Создать операцию(patientId, request, key)
Saga -> Idem: INSERT key, requestHash, sagaId, STARTED
Idem --> Saga: Состояние создано
Saga -> Policy: Проверить полис(patientId)
Policy --> Saga: VALID
Saga -> Idem: Сохранить POLICY_VERIFIED
Saga -> Schedule: Удержать слот(commandId, TTL=15m)
Schedule --> Saga: appointmentHoldId
Saga -> Idem: Сохранить DOCTOR_HELD
Saga -> LIS: Удержать слот анализа(commandId, TTL=15m)
LIS --> Saga: labReservationId
Saga -> Idem: Сохранить LAB_HELD
Saga -> Pay: Оплатить(merchantPaymentId=sagaId)
Pay -> Provider: POST payment с idempotency key
Provider --> Pay: PAID, providerPaymentId
Pay --> Saga: PAID
Saga -> Idem: Сохранить PAYMENT_COMPLETED
Saga -> Schedule: Подтвердить appointmentHoldId
Schedule --> Saga: CONFIRMED
Saga -> LIS: Подтвердить labReservationId
LIS --> Saga: CONFIRMED
Saga -> Idem: Сохранить COMPLETED и HTTP-ответ
Saga -> Broker: AppointmentConfirmed (outbox)
Saga --> BFF: 201 Created, appointmentId
BFF --> Gateway: Мобильный HTTP-ответ
Gateway --> App: 201 Created
App --> Patient: Показать подтверждение
Broker -> Notify: AppointmentConfirmed
Notify -> Patient: Push/SMS подтверждение
@enduml
